WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.712 --> 00:00:08.832
As hosts of the ceremony, the wedding parents in the lobby are the face that tells guests the celebration has begun.

2
00:00:09.168 --> 00:00:18.024
A parent's bright smile lifts the whole mood of the venue and gives guests a positive impression, like "Their parents seem so warm, their children must have grown up well."

3
00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:25.296
If nerves stiffen your expression instead, guests may hesitate to greet you and the festive mood can feel tense.

4
00:00:25.632 --> 00:00:28.680
A parent's stiff expression can even make people wonder, "Is something wrong with this marriage?"

5
00:00:29.016 --> 00:00:31.824
— that kind of doubt.

6
00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:40.536
The gentle laugh lines that appear when a parent smiles warmly aren't a sign of age but of kindness and character, and they photograph beautifully.

7
00:00:40.872 --> 00:00:46.320
A happy expression from the parents is the most positive blessing for their child's future.

8
00:00:46.656 --> 00:00:49.704
Practice your big smile ahead of time.
